  "body": "What: an \"Explain G-code (add a comment to each block)\" checkbox in the document and setup post-options pages (crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_options.rs, setup_post_page.rs), through SetPostOptions / SetSetupPostOptions so it is undoable; plus an MCP tool for post options (none exists today under crates/app/src/mcp/) that sets Explain, and the camcraft-mcp skill row. The UI says the program gets longer. Per crates/ui/AGENTS.md: structural assertions, no PNG change; the PR carries before/after screenshots.\nWhy: \"Commands ship with an MCP tool\"; user-facing switch for #1358.\nDone means: toggling the box is undoable and changes the posted text; the MCP tool sets and reads Explain for the document and a named setup; structural UI test and an MCP test pin both.\n\nPart of #1358. Needs the engine sub-issue first.\n",
